      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just want to concur with what's been said here, I've been struggling to get normal mapped avatars to render correctly on the quest, and it seems (from a few forum posts I've been able to find with the same issue) that this started cropping up after the Unity 2022 SDK was released.\n\nEdit: Thought I'd just link the posts here too. Linked in chronological order.\n\nFeb 12th: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/weird-normal-map-problem/22844\n\nMar 12th: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/normal-maps-not-working/23366\n\nApr 23rd: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/normal-map-issue/24132\n\nAug 20th: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/normals-looking-weird-on-quest/26283\n\nSep 30th: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/quest-normal-map-issue/27026",
